## Word Template Example (Late Payment Letter)

Below is the exact template I created in Word. The `«...»` fields are Word merge fields that map to SQL columns.


[Date]

«FirstName» «LastName»
«Address»
«City» «PostalCode»

RE: Invoice «InvoiceNumber» - Payment Overdue

Dear «FirstName»,

Our records show that invoice «InvoiceNumber» for RM«AmountDue» was due on «DueDate» and remains unpaid.

Please make payment within 7 days to avoid late fees.

If you have already made the payment, please disregard this notice.

Thank you for your prompt attention.

Sincerely,
Accounts Department







